  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 088f17897fcf240eda676a02ec7c2dea, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Digital Health Institute  \"Alamy\" platform for pain management
    and symptom tracking  The Digital Health Institute drives the integration of
    digital technologies in healthcare. Its focus is on health informatics, telemedicine,
    mobile health apps, electronic health records (EHR), and AI in healthcare. The
    institute\u2019s mission is to improve healthcare delivery and patient outcomes
    through data analytics, connected health systems, and digital innovations. It
    develops platforms for remote patient monitoring, decision support systems for
    clinicians (using AI for diagnostics), and health data networks that connect
    providers across the country. By harnessing big data and connectivity, the institute
    supports evidence-based medicine and more accessible healthcare services for
    all regions"
